            135  ************************************************************
            136  *                                                          *
            137  *                SYSTEM CRASH ROUTINE                      *
            138  *      THIS ROUTINE IS ENTERED WITH R1=0 AND IS MEANT TO   *
            139  *      LOCKUP THE SYSTEM SUCH THAT THE ONLY WAY OUT IS     *
            140  *      VIA RESET.                                          *
            141  *      ENTRY POINT IS 'CRASH$'                             *
            142  *                                                          *
            143  ************************************************************
0082 2860   144  CRASH$ XOR  @D$XR1,R1         BUILD 'X  R1' IN R1
0084 0038'
0086 0441   145         B    R1                EXECUTE IT
            146         END
